A sample project for the plugin tests (cmake/plugins.cmake), which run
the command lines of editor plugins and build scripts on a copy of this
tree, with ctags and with Universal Ctags, and compare.

src/            C and C++, one file with CRLF lines, one with a UTF-8 BOM
sub/            Fortran, free and fixed form
build/          generated code, excluded by wildignore.txt
third_party/    vendored code, excluded by .gutctags
.gutctags       a gutentags project options file
wildignore.txt  'wildignore' entries, as gutentags writes them
files.txt       a file list, as gutentags' file list command prints it

This README and the Makefile are not sources: ctags must skip them.

This is free and unencumbered software released into the public domain.
